msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Keep running until your pursuer is too tired\r\n"
"to chase you. If the <Color:7>pursuer's gauge runs out<Color:Default>\r\n"
"before yours does, you win. The pursuer's gauge\r\n"
"will gradually decrease during the chase."
msgstr ""

